  "description": "[The tear-inducing adventure of Anais, who must clean up a multi-level marketing scam left behind after the possessor left.]\n\nIn a continent ruled by a black dragon, “possessors” who disrupt the peace begin to appear out of nowhere one day.\n\nOne tries to seduce the Crown Prince by claiming, “I am the childhood first love you lost,” while another goes all the way to see the Northern Duke entirely on her own, proposing, “I know the future, so let’s enter a contract marriage.”\n\nSomeone even shows up right in front of the black dragon, declaring, “I will execute the evil dragon!”\n\nIn the end, the dragon loses its patience and executes the possessors, and the continent seemingly regains its peace step by step…\n\nBut then, a whopping 33rd possessor appears in the Lesser Kingdom of Belfast.\n\nUnlike the previous possessors, this one has absolutely no interest in the Crown Prince or the Northern Duke.\n\nInstead, she only thinks about hitting the jackpot with a scam and escaping to the imperial capital, pitching, Once you reach the Diamond Grade, money will just roll right in!\n\n…Until one day, like a divine punishment, a bolt of lightning strikes down upon the 33rd possessor.\n\nAnd at that exact moment, the real Anais—who had fallen asleep looking forward to her 19th birthday—returns.\n\nAnais got struck by lightning?\n\nAnd on top of that, she pulled off a massive fraud?? Me? The princess of Belfast?\n\nAnais, I think I’m going to faint…\n\nBut before Anais even gets a chance to pass out, Elliot, the Commander of the Azure Dragon Knights who hunts down possessors, barges in.\n\nCome along quietly!\n\nNo! That’s not it! She’s not here! She’s gone! She left!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69624046), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B9%99%EC%9D%98%EC%9E%90%EA%B0%80-%EB%8B%A4%EB%85%80%EA%B0%84-%ED%9B%84/4910)",
